body: `
<h2>Question 1</h2><p>100 vidyarthiyon me 60 ko ganit, 50 ko vigyan, aur 30 ko dono vishay pasand hain. Sirf ganit pasand karne wale aur kisi ko bhi pasand na karne wale kitne hain?</p><h3>Solution</h3><p>Only ganit = 60 - 30 = 30. Union = 60 + 50 - 30 = 80. Neither = 100 - 80 = 20.</p><p><strong>Answer: Only ganit 30, Neither 20</strong></p><h2>Question 2</h2><p>200 logon ke sarvekshan me A = 90, B = 80, C = 70, A aur B = 35, B aur C = 25, A aur C = 20, aur teeno = 10 hai. Sirf A, sirf B, sirf C, aur koi bhi na pasand karne wale ginon.</p><h3>Solution</h3><p>Only A aur B = 35 - 10 = 25. Only B aur C = 25 - 10 = 15. Only A aur C = 20 - 10 = 10. Only A = 90 - 25 - 10 - 10 = 45. Only B = 80 - 25 - 15 - 10 = 30. Only C = 70 - 10 - 15 - 10 = 35. Union = 45 + 30 + 35 + 25 + 15 + 10 + 10 = 170. Neither = 200 - 170 = 30.</p><p><strong>Answer: Only A 45, Only B 30, Only C 35, Neither 30</strong></p><h2>Question 3</h2><p>Kathan: Sabhi billiyan kutte hain. Kuch kutte sher hain. Nishkarsh 1: Kuch billiyan sher hain. Nishkarsh 2: Kuch sher billiyan hain. Kaun sa nishkarsh nishchit roop se satya hai?</p><h3>Solution</h3><p>Billiyon ka vritt kutton ke andar hai, aur kutton ka kuch hissa sheron se milta hai. Woh milne wala hissa billiyon wale hisse se mile, yeh zaroori nahi hai. Ek sambhav diagram me sher wala hissa billiyon se bahar bhi ho sakta hai. Isliye dono nishkarsh nishchit nahi hain.</p><p><strong>Answer: Koi bhi nishkarsh nishchit roop se satya nahi hai</strong></p><h2>Question 4</h2><p>500 logon me 300 ko chai, 250 ko coffee, aur 150 ko dono pasand hain. Sirf chai, sirf coffee, aur dono me se koi bhi na pasand karne wale kitne hain?</p><h3>Solution</h3><p>Only chai = 300 - 150 = 150. Only coffee = 250 - 150 = 100. Union = 150 + 100 + 150 = 400. Neither = 500 - 400 = 100.</p><p><strong>Answer: Only chai 150, Only coffee 100, Neither 100</strong></p><h2>Question 5</h2><p>Ek kaksha me 80 vidyarthi hain. 50 cricket khelte hain, 40 football khelte hain, aur 20 dono khelte hain. Sirf ek khel khelne wale kitne hain?</p><h3>Solution</h3><p>Only cricket = 50 - 20 = 30. Only football = 40 - 20 = 20. Exactly one = 30 + 20 = 50.</p><p><strong>Answer: 50</strong></p>
`
