excerpt: "BODMAS, chinh badalna aur coded operations wale sawalon ka poora concept aur tricks.",
body: `
<h2>Mathematical operations kya hai</h2><p>Is prakar ke sawalon me ganit ke chinhon ka arth badal diya jata hai, ya chinhon ko aapas me badal diya jata hai, aur phir diye gaye vyanyak ka maan nikalna hota hai. Kabhi kabhi aksharon se chinh dikhaye jate hain, jaise P ka matlab guna aur Q ka matlab bhag. Sabse pehle poora vyanyak padhkar naya arth likh lo, phir hi ganana shuru karo. Seedha purane chinhon se ganana karna sabse badi galti hai.</p><h2>BODMAS ka kram</h2><p>BODMAS ka kram hai: pehle koshthak, phir ghatank ya of, phir bhag aur guna, aur ant me jod aur ghatav. Bhag aur guna ka kram baayen se daayen hota hai, jo pehle aaye woh pehle hoga. Isi tarah jod aur ghatav bhi baayen se daayen hote hain. Udaaharan ke liye 18 bhag 3 guna 2 me pehle 18 bhag 3 = 6, phir 6 guna 2 = 12 hoga. Agar aap pehle 3 guna 2 kar denge to galat uttar milega. Koshthak ke andar ka kaam hamesha sabse pehle karo.</p><h2>Chinh badalne wale sawal</h2><p>Jab poochha jaye ki plus aur guna ko badal diya jaye, ya plus aur minus ko badal diya jaye, to poore vyanyak me har chinh ko uske naye chinh se badal do. Ek bhi chinh chhoot gaya to uttar galat ho jayega. Badalne ke baad BODMAS ke niyam se hi ganana karo, kyunki badle hue chinhon par bhi wahi kram lagu hota hai. Kabhi kabhi ank bhi badle jate hain, jaise 4 aur 8 aapas me badal diye jayen, tab pehle ank badlo phir chinh badlo, phir ganana karo.</p><h2>Coded operations</h2><p>Coded sawalon me akshar ya prateek diye jate hain. Pehle ek chhoti si table banao: kaun sa akshar kaun sa chinh hai. Phir vyanyak ko us table se badalkar likho. Uske baad BODMAS se hal karo. Yadi koi akshar do baar aaye to dono jagah wahi arth lagao. Prashn ko dhyan se padho, kyunki kabhi A ka matlab jod hota hai aur kabhi A ka matlab guna, har prashn ki code alag hoti hai.</p><h2>Solved Example 1</h2><p>Yadi plus ka matlab guna, guna ka matlab minus, minus ka matlab bhag, aur bhag ka matlab plus ho, to 12 plus 6 guna 4 minus 2 bhag 3 ka maan kya hoga? Naya vyanyak: 12 guna 6 minus 4 bhag 2 plus 3. Ganana: 12 guna 6 = 72. 4 bhag 2 = 2. Ab 72 - 2 + 3 = 73. Isliye uttar 73 hai.</p><h2>Solved Example 2</h2><p>Yadi P ka matlab guna, Q ka matlab bhag, R ka matlab jod, aur S ka matlab ghatav ho, to 24 Q 4 R 6 P 3 S 5 ka maan kya hoga? Naya vyanyak: 24 bhag 4 jod 6 guna 3 ghatav 5. Ganana: 24 bhag 4 = 6. 6 guna 3 = 18. Ab 6 + 18 - 5 = 19. Isliye uttar 19 hai.</p><h2>Solved Example 3</h2><p>Yadi plus aur minus badal diye jayen aur guna aur bhag badal diye jayen, to 12 plus 18 bhag 3 guna 2 minus 4 ka maan kya hoga? Naya vyanyak: 12 minus 18 guna 3 bhag 2 plus 4. Ganana: 18 guna 3 = 54. 54 bhag 2 = 27. Ab 12 - 27 + 4 = -11. Isliye uttar -11 hai. Rinatmak uttar se ghabrayen nahi, yeh bhi sahi ho sakta hai.</p><h2>Exam tricks</h2><ul><li>Pehle naya vyanyak poora likho, phir ganana karo.</li><li>BODMAS ka kram kabhi mat todo, khaas kar bhag aur guna me.</li><li>Koshthak wale sawal me andar se bahar ki taraf hal karo.</li><li>Dashamlav ya bhinn aane par ganana dobara jaanch lo.</li><li>Vikalp dekhkar andaza lagane ki jagah poori ganana karo.</li><li>Ank badalne wale sawal me pehle ank, phir chinh badlo.</li></ul><p>Mathematical operations me gati ke saath shuddhata bhi zaroori hai. Ek chhoti si chinh ki galti poora uttar badal deti hai, isliye naya vyanyak likhna hi sabse surakshit tareeka hai.</p>
`
